    m_Localized: Quit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16884790124302336
    m_Localized: Page {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 794851374009679874
  - m_Id: 16886103725789184
    m_Localized: Previus Page
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16886174743744512
    m_Localized: Next Page
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17021649831809024
    m_Localized: The nexus works just like a slingshot, grab the missile and pull
      it back, then release to send the projectile flying. Note that enemy units
      receive more damage from collisions with each other than from your projectiles
      (unless you are using special ammo).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17022353505996800
    m_Localized: Before firing each shot, take a look at the <color=#EC3F04>Stability
      indicator</color> at the bottom of the screen. The more velocity you give your
      shots (i.e., the farther back you pull the mouse), the higher the chance that
      the shot will misfire and explode near the nexus, damaging it in the process.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17032752058028032
    m_Localized: 'Each time enemy units is destroyed you gain <color=#EC3F04>Experience
      points</color>, once you have enough you will gain a <color=#EC3F04>Tech level</color>
      and <color=#EC3F04>5 skills</color> points to upgrade your nexus.


      You
      will be able to increase base stability, energy, obtain new projectiles and
      abilities.


      For more information go to <color=#00FF06>UPGRADES / ABILITIES</color>
      section.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17074289164898304
    m_Localized: <color=#00FE01>lives</color> determine how many enemy units may
      slip through past you, till you lose the game. When <color=#00FE01>lives</color>
      counter show infinity it either does not matter how may units survive at all
      or that you only have to destroy certain types of enemies (defined in the objectives).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17074631218778112
    m_Localized: On the Top is your score. You get points by destroying enemy units,
      unless the score is based on time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17185084875952128
    m_Localized: Press <color=#FF4500>Hotkeys</color>  to show or hide the hotkeys
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17186062471745536
    m_Localized: Select the missile type using "1" to "8" or pressing the missile
      icon on the bottom left
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17186431952179200
    m_Localized: Velocity and Stability bar are next to the missiles (described earlier)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17190361536876544
    m_Localized: "Next to the <color=#FFFFFF>Velocity</color>  and <color=#FFFFFF>Stability</color>
      bars are bars with the <color=#35C1FE>Energy</color> and <color=#FF6B00>Structure</color>
      values.\n<color=#35C1FE>Energy</color> is used each time you shoot or use habilities
      with energy consumption. \n<color=#FF6B00>Structure</color> is your hit points,
      when it reaches zero, your nexus will blow up."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17192184666607616
    m_Localized: Next to it there are the special abilities and on the right side
      the structure that can be place on the battlefield (see <color=#00FF06>UPGRADES
      / ABILITIES</color> section for info on both)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17193268164382720
    m_Localized: Sometimes when you destroy enemy units, powerups will fall out,
      click them to pick up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17204638620536832
    m_Localized: Fast nexus repairing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17204973162418176
    m_Localized: Fast energy regeneration.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17205384095158272
    m_Localized: 100% stability on all shoots.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17205631135469568
    m_Localized: Projectile speed amplifier.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17205867463528448
    m_Localized: Antimatter charges. You cant use any other ammo while this powerup
      is active
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17206123521593344
    m_Localized: No delay for all abilities.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17206361388961792
    m_Localized: Nuke. Drop it wherevwer you want.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17206367604920320
    m_Localized: Singularity Explosion. Most powerful weapon in the game. Note that
      sucked in units are not counted as killed, you get no score/exp points for
      those
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17226135753936896
    m_Localized: Some enemy units have special abilities.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17227330400768000
    m_Localized: Create a repulsion wave in a certain frequency that repulse incomming
      missiles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17227512265789440
    m_Localized: Have a shield in front that block all missiles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17227807016308736
    m_Localized: Have a chance of spawn a nuclear explosion on death
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17228372483985408
    m_Localized: Absorbs incomming missiles and heal itself
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17229464689135616
    m_Localized: If you let these two units collide, there will be a huge explosion
      and shockwave destroying everything, including the nexus.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35624633612324864
    m_Localized: 'Unused Skillpoints: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 794851374009679874
  - m_Id: 35631255168438272
    m_Localized: Level Up
    m_Metadata:
