      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37024626847993856
    m_Localized: Passive Upgrade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37024820922634240
    m_Localized: Nexus
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37025034765029376
    m_Localized: None
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37025335714729984
    m_Localized: General Info
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37025772048175104
    m_Localized: 'Description:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37026478452854784
    m_Localized: Increase your maximum energy by 3.5% per skillpoint, slightly increases
      energy replenish rate as well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37027264524144640
    m_Localized: Stability Upgrade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37028298789179392
    m_Localized: Increases base stability by 3.5% per skillpoint.Before firing each
      shot, take a look at the Stability Indicator at the bottom of the screen. The
      more velocity you give your shoots (the fartger back you pull the mouse), the
      higher the chance that the projectile will explode near the nexus, damaging
      it in the process. By upgrading stability you can get 100% at any velocity
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37037860283961344
    m_Localized: Projectile Upgrade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37038014269444096
    m_Localized: Can be upgraded once per 2 levels
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37038582790574080
    m_Localized: Enables you to use new projectile types
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37056045058052096
    m_Localized: Gravity Manipulator
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37056430476840960
    m_Localized: Active ability
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37057861183295488
    m_Localized: Enemy Unit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37059417102307328
    m_Localized: 'Enables you to pick up and throw your enemies. There are 3 levels
      of this ability. The first is reached at 5 spend skillpoints, the second requires
      10 more and the third one is kinda expensive :p

      lvl 1 - lift small enemy
      units

      lvl 2 - lift medium enemy units

      lvl 3- lift HUGE war machines'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37060912367489024
    m_Localized: Shockwave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37061214437068800
    m_Localized: Small Area
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37067298405044224
    m_Localized: Repels enemy from the point where it is applied with great force,
      hurling them away at great speed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37067973914480640
    m_Localized: Navigation Hack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37068208061501440
    m_Localized: Energy upgrade at lvl 10
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37068398046695424
    m_Localized: Damages the navigation system of enemy unit preventing it from reaching
      the destination
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37069728249237504
    m_Localized: Gravity Manipulator (Second modification)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37070081992642560
    m_Localized: Projectile
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37070205493923840
    m_Localized: Gravity Manipulator at lvl 1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37070355654201344
    m_Localized: Catch and throw launched projectiles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37071002923388928
    m_Localized: Huge Area
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37071103364386816
    m_Localized: Shockwave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37071247824605184
    m_Localized: Creates a gravity anomaly that sucks in enemy units with great power.
      Use it agains a group of enemy units and they will be crushed against each
      other
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37072802510491648
    m_Localized: Gravity Trap
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37073133810176000
    m_Localized: Structure
    m_Metadata:
